<view class="page"><view class="subject-banner"><text>就诊人：{{patientName||'请先选择'}}</text><view>{{patientCapacity}}</view><navigator url="/pages/patients/index" open-type="reLaunch">切换就诊人</navigator></view><view class="brand">ADC · 前台协调</view><view class="title">登记候补偏好</view><view class="subtitle">告诉我们可接受的范围，不必反复查询时段。</view><view class="card">
<label class="label">希望就诊的诊所</label><picker class="picker" range="{{clinics}}" range-key="name" value="{{clinicIndex}}" bindchange="pickClinic" disabled="{{busy}}">{{clinics[clinicIndex].name || '暂无诊所'}}</picker><label class="label">预约服务</label><picker class="picker" range="{{services}}" range-key="name" value="{{serviceIndex}}" bindchange="pickService" disabled="{{busy}}">{{services[serviceIndex].name || '暂无服务'}} · {{services[serviceIndex].duration || '—'}}分钟</picker><label class="label">医师偏好</label><picker class="picker" range="{{doctors}}" range-key="name" value="{{doctorIndex}}" bindchange="pickDoctor" disabled="{{busy}}">{{doctors[doctorIndex].name}}</picker>
<label class="label">最早可开始就诊（北京时间）</label><picker class="picker" mode="date" value="{{startDay}}" start="{{firstDay}}" end="{{lastDay}}" data-field="startDay" bindchange="field" disabled="{{busy}}">{{startDay}}</picker><picker class="picker time-picker" mode="time" value="{{startTime}}" data-field="startTime" bindchange="field" disabled="{{busy}}">{{startTime}}</picker><label class="label">最晚必须结束就诊（北京时间）</label><picker class="picker" mode="date" value="{{endDay}}" start="{{firstDay}}" end="{{lastDay}}" data-field="endDay" bindchange="field" disabled="{{busy}}">{{endDay}}</picker><picker class="picker time-picker" mode="time" value="{{endTime}}" data-field="endTime" bindchange="field" disabled="{{busy}}">{{endTime}}</picker>
</view><view class="notice">范围须能容纳完整服务，限未来十四天。每位患者同时保留一条有效候补；收到邀约后由你明确接受，已有预约继续保留。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" role="alert">{{error}}</view><button class="primary" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="preview">核对候补偏好</button><navigator open-type="switchTab" class="link" url="/pages/services/index">先了解服务内容 →</navigator><navigator class="link" url="/pages/waitlist/index">查看已有候补与邀约</navigator></view>
